  data: {
    LLM: "In Fipsen, with only 5 cards, an Ace-heavy hand is nearly unbeatable. If you hold two Aces, bid at least 3 tricks.\n\nThe 'Ruten' Trap: Be very careful bidding Diamonds. Since there is only ONE trump (the 7 of Diamonds), once it is played, the game reverts to plain suits. Only bid Ruten if you have strong length in a nonndtrump suit.\n\nDefensive Coordination: The three defenders must work together to bleed the bidder's trumps. If the bidder leads an Ace, the defenders should throw their highest offndsuit cards to force a trump play later.",
    Player: "In Fipsen, with only 5 cards, an Ace-heavy hand is nearly unbeatable. If you hold two Aces, bid at least 3 tricks.\n\nThe 'Ruten' Trap: Be very careful bidding Diamonds. Since there is only ONE trump (the 7 of Diamonds), once it is played, the game reverts to plain suits. Only bid Ruten if you have strong length in a nonndtrump suit.\n\nDefensive Coordination: The three defenders must work together to bleed the bidder's trumps. If the bidder leads an Ace, the defenders should throw their highest offndsuit cards to force a trump play later.",
